product_type":"c1","uid":2550743,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D0565908C99695","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/eb/d7/90391376.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1649651747,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":3,"score":5,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"用数字辅助工作，设定具体数字指标，可以发现问题，辅助决策，有效避免隔空对话。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":230788,"user_name":"sam","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000417,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8D48F4B9045947","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/43/e1/b7be5560.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1593492287,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"一看标题就好喜欢，可每次写总结或报告都发现手边没有数据可用…\n希望能从这课找到解决办法。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":205893,"user_name":"Jerry Wu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1203567,"ip_address":"","ucode":"AD29B6942AAAA6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/5d/6f/42494dcf.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1586751823,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"我在小公司工作，团队非常不完善，而且经常要同时做两三个项目，所以指标只有一个：开发时间，越短越好。\n\n首先，要确认每个项目的截止日期。\n然后，必须在截止日期前完成，开发会忽略很多细节，确保功能是按时完成，能用的。\n最后，如果能按时完成，客户就提出一堆新需求，开发新需求时，有剩余时间，再顺便完善前面的功能。\n\n这样在一开始，用户的体验会特别差，项目周期也特别长，但在条件限制下，完成任务才是最重要的。\n\n这是我个人的一些经历，总结起来：最块地完成任务。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1812970,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/a9/ea/5bfce6c5.jpg","nickname":"mgs2002","note":"","ucode":"F5931108BD509B","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":289738,"discussion_content":"有同感，小公司很多都是这样，老板都想越快出东西越好","content_length":25,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":15